ove by going to the capital city on the Dominican Republic.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1634845,\"title\":\"Todo Mundo no Rio com Shakira\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/32ncXoyC1MxdGJDqdR1ZvcCFmgZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j1lK6L1kn74BqaQtWec04U2i3EA.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On the iconic sands of Rio de Janeiro, Brazil, Shakira sets Copacabana Beach ablaze in the third edition of “Todo Mundo no Rio”. Before a historic crowd of 2 million people, the Colombian superstar celebrates three decades of hits in an electrifying performance that bridges her new album, “Las Mujeres Ya No Lloran,” with the timeless classics that defined her career. Featuring guest appearances by Brazilian music icons and a high-tech visual spectacle, the night transforms the coastline into the stage for an epic celebration of power, music, and the artist’s unbreakable connection with Brazil.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":565179,\"title\":\"The First King\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dqBU63M3cKy7pfVsmhrbgY5X8iv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tKyaXRcVAxYCqU9edDgjRmEKkMX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Romulus and Remus, two shepherds and loyal brothers, end up taking part to a journey that will lead one of them to be the founder of the greatest nation ever seen. However, the fate of the chosen one will pass from killing his own brother.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":543887,\"title\":\"Abuela's Luck\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cEvEdBwpuYne4DjdUB5t9gDxlLi.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Abuela's Luck is a story about appreciation and a lesson on luck. Some of us may not realize it, but luck can stem from our own past and have a direct affect on our future. We are introduced to Raymond, a 19 year-old Dominican-American who is asked by his Abuela to cash out what she assumes is a winning scratch off. Once at the bodega, we learn that Raymond has other plans in mind. And so does fate.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":529680,\"title\":\"La redención\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ohf5om1Q8Ykz09L3pnoTpYBmfmZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v33q9P3iAvOGyT47Gud2EjYUmMr.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1232553,\"title\":\"The Unbreakable Tatiana Suarez\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/24iOlmQYV5aUgzLARyzSQN3T6qH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pdZe9Sw5BKGDLrTWx7SmMAjpCgG.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Follow the exceptional spirit and drive of mixed martial arts (MMA) fighter Tatiana Suarez as she prepares to reenter the cage after nearly four years away from the sport. Suarez reflects on her journey from wrestling prodigy to professional athlete and the legacy she leaves young women, particularly those in the Latina community.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1254437,\"title\":\"#Whitina\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aVATtqQ6EVH6Ejkka3EnAa1MDWG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"High school cheerleader and whitina (white acting Latina) Genesis is forced to flee with her two former best friends after a recorded confrontation with undercover I.C.E. agents goes #viral. While on the run, the trio uncover secrets about one another and their immigration status, and ultimately learn what it really means to be \\\"down for La Raza.\\\"\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":855198,\"title\":\"The Prime Time of Your Life\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r5TtXA3WuMrHkSf